=== Cryptanalysis

Because $Pi$ is fixed across queries, concrete parameters must resist the fixed-partition algebraic
attack of cost $b^(d-1) min(b, d)$ with $d = ceil(k\/(b-1))$ (Section 7.4.1 of the paper), rather
than the stronger bound available when the partition is freshly randomized per query, which costs
somewhat larger ranks $k$ at equal security.

